{
    "0": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So the \"blood moon\" is a black Hole that leads to hell?."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "from all people in the world.",
                "Hell wants to steal holidays...Ok."

            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "....."
            ]
        },
        "63_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey, I can see you."
            ]
        },
        "64_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm talking to you!",
                "The hobo over there!"
            ]
        },
        "105_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah?",
                "You saw me."
            ]
        },
        "106_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Poltergeist Violinist",
                "Lunasa Prismriver"
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Calling anyone you see a hobo it's rude."
            ]
        },
        "107_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Specially a Gatekeeper at the crimson forest.",
                "Rude, Very rude."
            ]
        },
        "138_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You look nothing like a gatekeeper."
            ]
        },
        "139_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh well, I'm not a gatekeeper actually.",
                "It's just a self-proclaimed job."
            ]
        },
        "140_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Anyways then, I gotta keep going.",
                "Bye Hobo boy."
            ]
        },
        "141_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why did you called me then?"
            ]
        },
        "142_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Also, usually no one ever goes to past here.",
                "No human atleast."
            ]
        },
        "143_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm an Overlord of destruction! I can just go anywhere I want."
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "An Overlord?"
            ]
        },
        "204_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Extrovert Young Assassin",
                "Sam Tocamora"
            ]
        },
        "204_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh she's actually an Overlord!"
            ]
        },
        "205_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh She is?",
                "(Surprised)"
            ]
        },
        "206_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Poltergeist Keyboardist",
                "Emer Davies"
            ]
        },
        "206_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I knew it!",
                "one overlord would've ended up sucked by the mistress!"
            ]
        },
        "207_0": {
            "lines": [
                "\"Mistress's!?\"",
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What is all that crap about then?"
            ]
        },
        "209_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yeah that's mistress new plan.",
                "So we're getting holiday stuff in here now."
            ]
        },
        "210_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She's all the time busy with her servant..."
            ]
        },
        "211_0": {
            "lines": [
                "we are gatekeeping her mansion entrance.",
                "Since holiday people would try to enter here."
            ]
        },
        "212_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's pointless.",
                "You're going to be outnumbered by them, you know!"
            ]
        },
        "213_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's why we 3 are gatekeeping different areas."
            ]
        },
        "214_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You guys take that self-proclaimed job too seriously, huh."
            ]
        },
        "215_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, It's a very productive work."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yep, It's a very fun one!"
            ]
        },
        "217_0": {
            "lines": [
                "After this, you can go and get something to eat.",
                "If you survive."
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Even as gatekeepers you guys stinks ass."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Emer: Dammit...Next time, well give our best...",
                "Jeff: So...are you going or in?"
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yeah, that's my next stop."
            ]
        }
    },
    "10": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hmmm...That's one tall gate."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, well I can just fly over it anyways."
            ]
        },
        "101_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ahem Ahem..."
            ]
        },
        "102_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hell's introvert assassin",
                "Emer Davies"
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What do you think you're doing?"
            ]
        },
        "103_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was about to fly over this gate, don't you see? Duh."
            ]
        },
        "104_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Unfortunately, you can't do that~",
                "Only high-rank makai residents can pass the gate."
            ]
        },
        "105_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're telling me those demons that barely wear any clothing",
                "Are high-rank residents?"
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well...No! but...Dammit! You get it!",
                "Only makai residents."
            ]
        },
        "107_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh well!"
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I am a makai resident. Look at me closely~"
            ]
        },
        "109_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Modern Day Assassin",
                "Jeff Kimarumi"
            ]
        },
        "109_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Emer, That's an overlord!",
                "Or well, a semi-overlord."
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Come on how can you tell?",
                "I don't look thaaaat different from you guys."
            ]
        },
        "111_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm surprised how you can recognize overlords from others!"
            ]
        },
        "112_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hell's extrovert assassin",
                "Sam Tocamora"
            ]
        },
        "112_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's easy! She's wearing an uniform!",
                "Overlords ego makes them wear those kinda outfits"
            ]
        },
        "113_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Alright, Alright you got me."
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And what's the problem if Im an semi-overlord?"
            ]
        },
        "115_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, You're probably a holiday person..."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She probably is.",
                "We've have been gatekeeping this place from themm."
            ]
        },
        "117_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I know right! Look at the pumpkins as her shooting options!",
            ]
        },
        "118_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You guys gatekeeping?",
                "While looking like a bunch of people living in the trash?"
            ]
        },
        "119_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's a bit too much to say coming from halloween...",
                "Don't you think?"
            ],
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was thinking she could be from christmas country.",
                "That ribbon on her head says a lot."
            ]
        },
        "121_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Or easter country!"
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Are we really discussing from what holiday is she?"
            ]
        },
        "123_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So, are you guys done talking?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "11": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Also, I'm from halloween. Is that hard to notice?"
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Emer: Defeated by a holiday person. How humillating!"
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Anyways, I'm flying over the gate.",
                "I wonder if that castle over there is safe."
            ]
        },
        "63_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Sam: Do you think that ominous looking castle is safe?",
                "Jeff: of course it's not!"
            ]
        },
        "64_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Good point..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "20": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "One long stage...just to get in hell."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That moon over there looks like the one back there."
            ]
        },
        "101_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I've heard that anyone that enters there..."
            ]
        },
        "102_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hell's Extrovert assassin",
                "Sam Turumora"
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Comes back as a corpse!",
                "All weak, without a reason to live anymore. Terrifying isn't it?"
            ]
        },
        "103_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Where I come from is no different. Dooooon't worry."
            ]
        },
        "105_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hmmm...... is That so?",
                "but You don't seem like a hell Cat."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I am hell cat, what do you mean?",
                "Meow. See?"
            ]
        },
        "107_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's a very normal meow...I'ts not hellish enough!"
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're just a regular Cat-girl!"
            ]
        },
        "109_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So how the hell do I become a Hell Cat then?"
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "By being a little idiot like you?"
            ]
        },
        "111_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Assassin of the modern days",
                "Jeff Himarumi"
            ]
        },
        "111_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Sam, are you Fighting with that other cat?"
            ]
        },
        "112_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well he started."
            ]
        },
        "113_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hell's introvert Assassin",
                "Emer Davies"
            ]
        },
        "113_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Sam rarely starts fights. She's probably lying!"
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm a good Cat! Unlike you..."
            ]
        },
        "115_0": {
            "lines": [
                "\"I'm a good Cat, Unlike you...\"",
                "I'm cuddly and beautiful."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What!? no You're not!"
            ]
        },
        "117_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's strange, you both are very cuddly."
            ]
        },
        "118_0": {
            "lines": [
                "One is a hellish cat,",
                "the other one is a grumpy cat from christmas country!"
            ]
        },
        "119_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm from halloween country!",
                "Christmas country cats are all gingery and weird."
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Holiday people are all weird anyways~"
            ]
        },
        "121_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ok Ok You know what? You three can just rot in hell!"
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ahem, but We're already in hell!"
            ]
        },
        "123_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And you're a stupid kid, shut up!"
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You should've probably said \"Go and rot in the ninth layer of hell!\""
            ]
        },
        "125_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Then go and rot in the ninth layer of hell!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "21": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I get it now, You guys are assassins.",
                "And very bad ones."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
